{"title": "Eggbearer (Condition)", "pageid": 30016, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eggbearer_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eggbearer Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Eggbearer_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Eggbearer</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Carries an owlbear's egg. Its scent will attract the egg's mother. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Honour_mode\">Honour mode</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Carries an owlbear's egg. Its scent will attract the egg's <b>parents</b>.</li></ul>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Eggbearer\">Sources of Eggbearer</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Egg\" title=\"Owlbear Egg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/FOOD_Owlbear_Egg_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Egg\" title=\"Owlbear Egg\">Owlbear Egg</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1211/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14806/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argu